{
  "_help": "Your morning brief settings. Edit freely; no code changes needed. news: feeds grouped by section (any RSS/Atom URL works). news_per_section: max headlines per section. gmail.query uses the same search syntax as the Gmail search box. keep_pages: how many days of old briefs to keep. name: used in the greeting. email_me: also send the page to your own Gmail (for your phone).",

